<title>JAPAN: GOLF-CASIO WORLD OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-CASIO WORLD OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results after final round of the Casio World Open at the Ibusuki Golf Club (7,028 yards, par-72) on Sunday (Japanese unless stated):</p>
<p>277 Paul Stankowski (U.S.) 69 69 71 68 (winner in playoff),</p>
<p>David Ishii (U.S.) 69 70 72 66</p>
<p>278 Masashi Ozaki 74 67 68 69, Tateo Ozaki 70 69 70 69</p>
<p>279 Carlos Franco (Paraguay) 73 67 68 71</p>
<p>280 Yoshikazu Sakamoto 72 70 70 68, Hisayuki Sasaki 74 69 66</p>
<p>71</p>
<p>281 Yutaka Hagawa 69 72 70 70, Tsukasa Watanabe 70 74 66 71,</p>
<p>Peter Teravainen (U.S.) 70 70 69 72</p>
<p>282 Brian Watts (U.S.) 71 72 71 68, Robert Gamez (U.S.) 69</p>
<p>73 72 68</p>
<p>284 Kiyoshi Murota 69 73 73 69, Mitsutaka Kusakabe 70 70 74</p>
<p>70, Saburo Fujiki 74 70 70 70, Shigeki Maruyama 72 69 70</p>
<p>73</p>
<p>285 Kazuyoshi Hosokawa 71 70 75 69, Shoichi Kuwabara 70 73</p>
<p>71 71, Tsuyoshi Yoneyama 70 74 68 73, Tomohiro Maruyama</p>
<p>71 70 70 74.</p>
